Impact: "invoice PDF opens uncorrupted" (NEARS-832/857) is unachievable against this backend —
the DM-app consumer was orphaned when the web invoice route was session-gated (audit hardening).
Needs a DM-token-authenticated /api/v1 invoice endpoint or an auth('delivery_man')-aware gate.
